# meta-openvario recipes

- Add OpenVario recipes under `meta-openvario/recipes-*`. The layer
  collects `recipes-*/*/*.bb` and `*.bbappend` (`conf/layer.conf`).
- Pin a git app with `SRCREV` in the versioned recipe, and keep the
  shared steps in the existing `.inc`. XCSoar is `recipes-apps/xcsoar/`.
- Prefer a `bbappend` over a copy of an upstream recipe.
- `do_install` runs under fakeroot. Do not `cp -a` a host tree into the
  package. Files owned by the BitBake uid outside `/home` fail the
  `host-user-contaminated` QA check.
- `externalsrc` skips `do_patch`. The container must mount that source
  tree. The recipe `SRCREV` is what a normal build fetches.
- Machine files set `SHORT_OV_MACHINE`. Cubieboard 2 boards include
  `ov-cubieboard2.inc`.
- Distro policy is `conf/distro/ovlinux.conf`. Packages are ipk.
- After a recipe commit on `scarthgap`, the parent repository updates
  the `meta-openvario` gitlink in its own commit.
